<title>TAIWAN: TABLE-Taiwan President Jan-June profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Taiwan President Jan-June profit up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June</p>
<p>			    (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				12,803   vs    13,015</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 2,476   vs     1,421</p>
<p>NOTE - President Enterprises Corp is Taiwan's largest food processor and the island's top investor in China with over US$900 million worth of mainland projects. The company has set a 1997 pre-tax profit target of T$5.05 billion on sales of T$27.7 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
